 ('L2','Investigate suspected AD CS escalation',['Locate certificate template change, CA approval and enrollment logs.','Resolve requester identity, source host, serial and template properties.','Map newly available enrollment principals and dangerous authentication settings.','Correlate certificate-based logons and any downstream privilege.','Preserve affected CA configuration and change approval record.','Coordinate rollback/certificate revocation with PKI owners under incident policy.']),
 ('L2','Scope RMM abuse',['Identify the RMM product, service creation timestamp and signer.','Trace installing process, account and remote relay domains.','Compare deployment inventory with helpdesk ticket and intended scope.','Examine unattended-access setting and outbound remote session metadata.','Determine affected hosts and whether credentials or data were accessed.','Get approval before disabling critical remote support tooling.']),
 ('L2','Cloud audit trail outage response',['Confirm which event types, regions, resources and accounts are in scope.','Review selector and integration changes with timestamps and actor session.','Preserve management-plane configuration change records.','Cross-check storage, workload or provider-side independent logs.','Restore intended collection under infrastructure change control.','Estimate blind-window uncertainty and assign follow-up threat hunt.']),
 ('L2','Investigate suspected lateral movement',['Correlate source logon with target 4624/4672 and network connections.','Look for service creation, remote scheduled tasks and PowerShell remoting.','Map source/target roles, service accounts and approved admin tooling.','Check for new credentials, persistence, file copy or access expansion.','Create host/identity graph with stable timestamps and IDs.','Escalate multi-host incident and propose coordinated containment.']),
 ('L2','Document data-access impact',['List objects, databases or files that have access records.','Separate metadata listing, read, download, archive and outbound transfer.','Record tenant/account/session identity and relevant destination.','Estimate sensitivity and affected population with data owners.','Note missing event sources and uncertainty of transfer claims.','Pass impact facts to authorized privacy/legal teams without inventing notification decisions.']),
 ('L3','Ship detection with regression controls',['Write behavior, prerequisites and expected benign patterns.','Map event sources to actual available fields and ingestion health.','Create exact known-positive and representative negative fixtures.','Test converted SPL/KQL query and alert thresholds on target environment.','Check latency, cardinality, false-positive volume and exception boundaries.','Version rule and deployment, assign owner, and schedule retest.']),
 ('L3','Test suppression blast radius',['Record why the suppression is needed and its proposed expiry.','Enumerate all covered assets, identities, process patterns and time windows.','Run positives both inside and outside intended exception scope.','Run benign baseline and compare analyst workload and latency.','Require reviewer approval for high-risk global exceptions.','Deploy scoped policy with rollback and canary results.']),
 ('L3','Run a hypothesis-driven hunt',['Write a behavior-based hypothesis with explicit expected signals.','Define population, baseline timeframe and data source limits.','Build entity-scoped queries using stable identifiers and UTC.','Check competing explanations and outliers by peer group.','Decide supported, refuted or unresolved with cited event IDs.','Create a detection engineering ticket for repeatable patterns and identified blind spots.']),
 ('L3','Handle critical restoration trade-off',['Confirm business RTO/RPO and named incident commander.','Identify volatile and soon-to-expire evidence and preservation approvals.','Determine least disruptive acquisition compatible with recovery.','Track containment, isolation and dependency effects for critical services.','Document what cannot be preserved and confidence consequences.','Validate service recovery and detection coverage after restart.']),
